#: title/pc5_ui.c:5884
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: VKD3D-Proton turns the game's Direct3D 12 into Vulkan. The "
"fastest, and what most games want."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan PC5: VKD3D-Proton mengubah Direct3D 12 game menjadi Vulkan. Paling "
"cepat, dan yang dibutuhkan sebagian besar game."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5885
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: Wine's own Direct3D draws the game's DirectDraw with OpenGL."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan PC5: Direct3D milik Wine menggambar DirectDraw game dengan OpenGL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5886
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: DXVK turns the game's Direct3D into Vulkan. The fastest, and "
"what most games want."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan PC5: DXVK mengubah Direct3D game menjadi Vulkan. Paling cepat, dan "
"yang dibutuhkan sebagian besar game."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5888
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Slower than Auto; try it if the game won't "
"start or draws wrong."
msgstr ""
"Direct3D 12 milik Wine (VKD3D). Lebih lambat dari Otomatis; coba jika game "
"tidak mau jalan atau gambarnya salah."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5890
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with Vulkan. Try it if the game draws wrong "
"with Auto; often faster than WineD3D."
msgstr ""
"Direct3D milik Wine, menggambar dengan Vulkan. Coba jika gambar game salah "
"dengan Otomatis; sering lebih cepat dari WineD3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5891
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with OpenGL. The slowest; try it if the game "
"won't start with the others."
msgstr ""
"Direct3D milik Wine, menggambar dengan OpenGL. Paling lambat; coba jika "
"game tidak mau jalan dengan yang lain."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5912
#, c-format
msgid "The game uses %s"
msgstr "Game memakai %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5924
msgid "In use"
msgstr "Dipakai"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5944
msgid ""
"PC5 runs your PC games with prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 to 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12, and Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for OpenGL)."
msgstr ""
"PC5 menjalankan game PC Anda dengan prospero-win: Wine, DXVK untuk "
"Direct3D 8 hingga 11, VKD3D-Proton untuk Direct3D 12, dan Mesa (RADV untuk "
"Vulkan, Zink untuk OpenGL)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5946
msgid ""
"Covers come from Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki and Wikidata, and SteamGridDB "
"with your key. No game is part of PC5."
msgstr ""
"Sampul berasal dari Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki, dan Wikidata, serta "
"SteamGridDB dengan kunci Anda. Tidak ada game yang termasuk dalam PC5."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5947
msgid "Free software under the GNU LGPL 2.1 or later."
msgstr "Perangkat lunak bebas di bawah GNU LGPL 2.1 atau yang lebih baru."

