#: title/pc5_ui.c:6414
#, c-format
msgid ""
"1. Scan the code with your phone. GitHub's form for a new issue opens, "
"filled in with %s, PC5's version and what PC5 saw."
msgstr ""
"1. Pindai kode dengan ponsel Anda. Formulir GitHub untuk issue baru akan "
"terbuka, terisi dengan %s, versi PC5, dan apa yang dilihat PC5."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6417
#, c-format
msgid "1. On your phone or computer, open %s and choose New issue."
msgstr "1. Di ponsel atau komputer, buka %s lalu pilih New issue."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6420
#, c-format
msgid "2. Copy %s off the console, from %s/logs, as you copy files to it."
msgstr ""
"2. Salin %s dari konsol, dari %s/logs, dengan cara yang sama seperti Anda "
"menyalin file ke konsol."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6424
msgid ""
"3. Say what happened, attach the zip, and submit. You need a GitHub "
"account."
msgstr ""
"3. Ceritakan apa yang terjadi, lampirkan zip, lalu kirim. Anda perlu akun "
"GitHub."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6437
msgid "PC5's web page"
msgstr "Halaman web PC5"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6441
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Scan the code with your phone, or open %s in a browser on a PC on the same "
"network."
msgstr ""
"Pindai kode dengan ponsel Anda, atau buka %s di browser pada PC di "
"jaringan yang sama."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6444
msgid ""
"From there: send a game's folder to install, report a problem with a game "
"(its log and settings go with it), edit launch options and download logs. "
"It works while PC5 is open."
msgstr ""
"Dari sana: kirim folder game untuk diinstal, laporkan masalah pada game "
"(log dan pengaturannya ikut terkirim), ubah opsi peluncuran, dan unduh "
"log. Bisa dipakai selama PC5 terbuka."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6461
msgid ""
"Scan the code with your phone: PC5's wiki opens on the list of games "
"players have tried, how each ran and the settings that helped."
msgstr ""
"Pindai kode dengan ponsel Anda: wiki PC5 terbuka di daftar game yang sudah "
"dicoba pemain, bagaimana masing-masing berjalan, dan pengaturan yang "
"membantu."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6463
msgid ""
"On your phone or computer, open "
"github.com/bornaradusin/PC5/wiki/Game-compatibility: the games players "
"have tried, how each ran and the settings that helped."
msgstr ""
"Di ponsel atau komputer, buka "
"github.com/bornaradusin/PC5/wiki/Game-compatibility: game yang sudah "
"dicoba pemain, bagaimana masing-masing berjalan, dan pengaturan yang "
"membantu."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6466
msgid ""
"Got a game running? Add a game, at the top of the list's page: the form "
"takes a minute. You need a GitHub account."
msgstr ""
"Berhasil menjalankan game? Pakai Add a game, di bagian atas halaman "
"daftar: formulirnya cuma butuh semenit. Anda perlu akun GitHub."

