msgid ""
"Keep saves: the game goes, its saves and settings stay, and installing it "
"again puts them back. Delete all: the game, its saves and settings go, "
"with no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Pertahankan simpanan: game dihapus, data simpanan dan pengaturannya tetap, "
"dan menginstalnya lagi akan mengembalikannya. Hapus semua: game, data "
"simpanan, dan pengaturannya dihapus, tanpa cadangan dan tidak bisa "
"dibatalkan."

