#: title/pc5_web_page.html:47
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Game compatibility list"
msgstr "Daftar kompatibilitas game"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:48
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Help (wiki)"
msgstr "Bantuan (wiki)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:49
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem with PC5"
msgstr "Laporkan masalah pada PC5"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:52
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Send a game"
msgstr "Kirim game"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:53
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr ""
"Pilih folder game: folder ini dikirim ke folder INSTALL PC5, lalu PC5 akan "
"menawarkan untuk menginstalnya."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:55
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose a folder"
msgstr "Pilih folder"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:57
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"A phone that can't choose a folder: type the game's folder name, then "
"choose its files."
msgstr ""
"Ponsel yang tidak bisa memilih folder: ketik nama folder game, lalu pilih "
"file-nya."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:60
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose files"
msgstr "Pilih file"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Games"
msgstr "Game"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Muat ulang"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:68 title/pc5_web_page.html:74
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "Memuat…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:71
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "Log"

#. Web page text.
#. Keep <b>...</b> and <code>...</code> around the same words.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:72
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Attach one to an issue on GitHub when a game has a problem: a game's "
"<b>Report a problem</b> above downloads its newest log and opens GitHub's "
"form with the game, PC5 and its settings filled in."
msgstr ""
"Lampirkan salah satunya ke issue di GitHub jika game bermasalah: "
"<b>Laporkan masalah</b> pada game di atas akan mengunduh log terbarunya "
"dan membuka formulir GitHub dengan game, PC5, dan pengaturannya sudah "
"terisi."

#. Web page text.
#. A text box's hint, shown in it while it is empty.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:59
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The game's folder name"
msgstr "Nama folder game"

#. Web page text.
#. A text box's hint, shown in it while it is empty.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:67
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Find a game"
msgstr "Cari game"

